WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A starting point for Downloads.
Review suggestions. Keep the final say.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
An installer appears because a matching app appears installed.
Check that you no longer need its disk image.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.000
Similar filenames and matching sizes suggest a possible copy.
In v1.0, contents are not compared. Check both files.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
An older export might still matter.
Age is a reason to review, not proof it is unwanted.

00:20.000 --> 00:26.000
Ignore dismisses the suggestion from the current review.
The file stays in Downloads. It can return on refresh.

00:26.000 --> 00:31.000
Select only the files you no longer need.
Choose Move to Trash to open the confirmation.

00:31.000 --> 00:37.000
The confirmation names the selected file.
You can cancel before it moves.

00:37.000 --> 00:41.000
The selected installer is now in Trash.
Recover it in Finder before emptying the Trash.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
Try Trayage for Mac. File review is free.
Trayage never empties the Trash. trayage.app
